-- lint-disable-file rule-dead-code
-- (`batchEntryDummy` is an intentional unreferenced placeholder — this file
-- exists only to force-import every compiler module into one closure.)
--
-- Synthetic entry for the batch typecheck harness, LEG A of
-- test/diff_compiler_selfproc.sh.  It imports one name from every
-- compiler module so that `loadProgram` pulls them ALL into a single union
-- closure — then one check_all_main.mdk run emits every module's schemes in one
-- process instead of several.  The imports exist only to force the closure; the
-- module's own (empty-ish) schemes are ignored by the harness.

